   "y": 10,
   "w": 760,
   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "Prenatal genetics: a SCREEN gives a RISK · a DIAGNOSTIC test gives the ANSWER",
   "lines": [
    "BEFORE pregnancy: 3-generation pedigree, red flags → refer · carrier screening by ancestry: the MOTHER first, the partner if she is a carrier",
    "IN pregnancy: offer every couple screening after discussion; they opt in or out · baseline 2–3% congenital anomaly whatever the screen"
   ]
  },
